			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-30f06e1 elementor-testimonial--skin-bubble elementor-testimonial--align-left elementor-widget-tablet__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-testimonial--layout-image_inline elementor-arrows-yes elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial-carousel" data-id="30f06e1" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;slides_per_view&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;show_arrows&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;speed&quot;:500,&quot;autoplay&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;autoplay_speed&quot;:5000,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_hover&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_interaction&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;space_between&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;space_between_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;space_between_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}" data-widget_type="testimonial-carousel.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-swiper">
					<div class="elementor-main-swiper swiper" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Slides">
				<div class="swiper-wrapper">
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						"Carl Albert was perfect for me. I wasn’t ready to attend a big school and had the idea that the only way to get a degree was by attending a class in person. With Carl Albert I was able to graduate in the comfort of my home!"					</div>
									</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
											</div>
		</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						"I have really enjoyed my journey at Carl Albert while seeking my Allied Health degree. The exceptional help from Carl Albert staff and students has helped me in choosing to continue my education here in the nursing program!"					</div>
									</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
											</div>
		</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						"I loved it! I loved the closeness of everyone, and felt I was able to go anywhere for help if needed."					</div>
									</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
											</div>
		</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						"My overall experience at CASC was amazing!  All faculty was very patient and helpful.  My nursing instructors were wonderful and very attentive to our needs.  Even to this day, all staff at the hospital brag on the CASC nursing students and their instructors.  I will always recommend CASC."					</div>
									</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
											</div>
		</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						"Carl Albert is full of instructors that want to see you succeed and will do about anything to help you get there."					</div>
									</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
											</div>
		</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						"I had a wonderful experience obtaining my associates in child development.  Every instructor helped me grow in knowledge and confidence as a non-traditional, first generation student seeking my degree.  Because of my positive experience at Carl Albert, I was prepared to seek my bachelor's and master's degrees and now work in education myself investing in students."					</div>
									</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
											</div>
		</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						"I love being a Viking! Love the online courses, you guys are so helpful and supportive! Thank you, for helping me earn my certificate in Child Development. I am re-rolled for the Fall semester CASC to continue and earn my associates degree, can't wait for another great school year!!!"					</div>
									</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
											</div>
		</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						"I loved being apart of Carl Albert for two years. I will always appreciate the people who poured into me, with knowledge and love. I am so glad I had the opportunity to go somewhere I thought would never be possible."					</div>
									</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
											</div>
		</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						"Before college, I was out of school for 10 years. It was a fresh new start, I learned the basics again, math and more. I’m able to apply my knowledge towards my future and job. My brain is filled with information to understand the very world we live in."					</div>
									</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
											</div>
		</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						"Carl Albert was an awesome college with great teachers, coaches and students. I made memories that will last a lifetime. I was a baseball player there and loved playing and representing Carl Albert. I became not only a better athlete going to school there but a smarter student as well with the strong academics."					</div>
									</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
											</div>
		</div>
								</div>
